///                                    * Program the metadata.m33Lms2Ipt[1][0] value in sign magnitude format
///                                    ###
///     @ 0x00028 LMS2IPT2             (P)
///               %signmagn 16 coeff4                    52638
///                                    ###
///                                    * LMS2IPT matrix coefficient[1][1], represented as a 1.13 signed magnitude integer, in the range of ( -1, 1 ).
///                                    * Program the metadata.m33Lms2Ipt[1][1] value in sign magnitude format
